   "description": "Built based on the specifications issued to French military pilots in the 1950s, the Type 20 brings a no-compromise chronograph back to the wrist. Its matte black dial ensures immediate legibility in all conditions with the luminous Arabic numerals. Framing the dial: a friction-based, bidirectional bezel with a red triangle marker. Inside, the SL4617III hand-wound movement delivers 45 hours of power reserve and 28,800 vibrations per hour. The 37mm case is fully polished stainless steel, paired with an oversized crown for confident manual winding and adjustment. Flip it over, and you’ll have the option to personalize your caseback with the portrait of your choice.",
